<title>ARGENTINA: Central Puerto CEP BA Q1 consolidated net $7.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Central Puerto CEP BA Q1 consolidated net $7.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31.</p>
<p>Non consolidated EPS $0.09 vs $0.07</p>
<p>Non consolidated earnings per ADR $0.45 vs $0.34</p>
<p>Consolidated net $7.9 million vs $6.1 million</p>
